#: ../../source/index.rst:156
#: 1f02e81061cd49ac9cd055e7ad6387b2
msgid "History"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:158
#: 35938e80bf5646aeb8101f6d4f3530d9
msgid "The DIYDrones community provided an initial home for ArduPilot. From those hobbyist beginnings, ArduPilot led the professionalisation of the Open Source drone community by creating DroneCode. Since leaving DroneCode in 2016 ArduPilot has grown further to stand as an independent, open, global project. The comprehensive and ever growing list of ArduPilot features are continually born from the needs of the community - be they hobbyists, commercial users, academics, or the largest of enterprises. See the :ref:`history-of-ardupilot` for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:166
#: cf5825608b5a4f6c8922c6fd3b9870fc
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:175
#: 2eb81dfafa524c72bb8cbb36672bcde4
msgid "Thorough documentation of the available features backed by a community to help you set up any vehicle to fit your needs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:177
#: cdf2ba77de184779a44a7bc1a9bf8ba5
msgid "Many command modes to fit every type of vehicle: Acro, Stabilize, Loiter, Alt-hold, Return To Launch, Land, Follow Me, GeoFence, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:180
#: d5442b4311a247f8b18e2f6d1a97d6f2
msgid "Autonomous flight modes that execute fully scripted missions with advanced features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:182
#: 7fc550615b66426293277a502f5c7629
msgid "Advanced failsafe options bring peace of mind in the event of lost control signal, low battery conditions, or other system failures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:184
#: e7c11e64d30041deb2c34b9b901d3e99
msgid "Three Axis camera control and stabilization, shutter control, live video link with programmable on-screen-display"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:194
#: 4cc440bd7a2645b7bdab9df36d46af31
msgid "Real-time two-way communication between your GCS and controller, including GPS position, battery status, and other live information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:196
#: 3da1cab965574ebd86db52d3d9507a70
msgid "Full data logging for comprehensive post mission analysis, with graphing and Google Earth mapping tools"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:198
#: 720028f5c3bf42fc9c2fed5975103671
msgid "Industry leading control algorithms for vehicles of all types, with robust sensor compensation algorithms, filtering and tuning capabilities"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.rst:201
#: 40bcb019594943c094f97e43773662f7
msgid "No dead ends -- Advanced users will find endless options for customization and expanded mission capabilities"
msgstr ""

